10 REM LOGIC GARDEN 122: TEAM REFUSAL
20 PRINT CHR$(147) : REM CLEAR
30 POKE 53280, 0 : POKE 53281, 0 : REM BLACK

40 REM --- POINTERS ---
50 POKE 2040, 200 : REM DOG RIGHT
60 POKE 2041, 202 : REM BOY RIGHT

100 REM --- SETUP ---
110 V = 53248
120 POKE V+21, 3 : REM ENABLE 0,1
130 POKE V+39, 7 : REM DOG
140 POKE V+40, 3 : REM BOY
150 POKE V+23, 3 : POKE V+29, 3 : REM EXPAND
160 POKE V+1, 150 : POKE V+3, 145

200 REM --- IN (RIGHTWARD) ---
210 FOR X = 0 TO 150 STEP 2
220   BX = X : DX = X + 45 : REM DOG LEADS
230   GOSUB 1000
240   FOR W=0 TO 5:NEXT W
250 NEXT X

300 REM --- PAUSE ---
310 FOR T = 0 TO 800 : NEXT T

400 REM --- TURN ---
410 POKE 2040, 201 : REM DOG LEFT
420 POKE 2041, 203 : REM BOY LEFT
430 FOR T = 0 TO 300 : NEXT T

500 REM --- OUT (LEFTWARD) ---
510 FOR X = 150 TO 0 STEP -3
520   BX = X : DX = X + 45 : REM DOG FOLLOWS
530   GOSUB 1000
540   FOR W=0 TO 5:NEXT W
550 NEXT X

600 END

1000 REM --- POSITION ---
1010 POKE V, DX : POKE V+2, BX
1020 REM ASSUME X < 255 FOR SIMPLE LEFT-SIDE DEMO
1030 POKE V+16, 0
1040 RETURN
